{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" initial=\"a\" datamodel=\"ecmascipt\">\n  <state id=\"a\"><onentry><script>var x = ;</script></onentry><transition event=\"go\" target=\"b\"/></state>\n  <final id=\"b\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml044-unknown-datamodel.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml044-unknown-datamodel.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":9,"byteOffset":84,"endColumn":94,"endLine":1,"startColumn":85,"startLine":1},"insertedContent":{"text":"ecmascript"}}]}],"description":{"text":"use the `ecmascript` data model"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml044-unknown-datamodel.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":94,"endLine":1,"startColumn":85,"startLine":1}}}],"message":{"markdown":"unknown data model `ecmascipt`\n\n**Note:** SCXML 1.0 §5.1 defines the `ecmascript`, `null`, and `xpath` data models; an unrecognized data model fails closed because none of this machine's expressions can be evaluated or syntax-checked\n\n**Help:** did you mean `ecmascript`?\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.1 Data Model","text":"unknown data model `ecmascipt`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":93,"start":84},"category":"semantic"},"ruleId":"SCXML044"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"SCXML 1.0 §5.1 defines the `ecmascript`, `null`, and `xpath` data models; an unrecognized value (often a typo) fails closed because none of the machine's expressions can be evaluated or syntax-checked. The value is `xsd:NMTOKEN`, whose white space collapses (XML Schema 1.1 Part 2 §4.3.6), so `datamodel=\" xpath \"` is `xpath`"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: use `ecmascript` for JavaScript expressions, or `null` for a machine without data.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §5.1 Data Model\n\nRun `scx --explain SCXML044` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#data-module","id":"SCXML044","name":"SCXML044","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"the `datamodel` attribute names a data model this validator does not recognize"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}